   "id": "Nat",
   "generated_kind": null,
   "external": true,
   "docstring":
   "The natural numbers, starting at zero.\n\nThis type is special-cased by both the kernel and the compiler, and overridden with an efficient\nimplementation. Both use a fast arbitrary-precision arithmetic library (usually\n[GMP](https://gmplib.org/)); at runtime, `Nat` values that are sufficiently small are unboxed.\n"},
